# Closed input set for offline runtime/test packaging. All wheel acquisition
# uses the shared verified wheelhouse and an explicit streamed BuildKit context.
**
!Dockerfile
!pyproject.toml
!requirements/
!requirements/runtime.lock
!requirements/build.lock
!src/
!src/**
!tests/
!tests/**/*.py
!tests/fixtures/catalog.toml
!tools/
!tools/fixtures/
!tools/fixtures/protocol.py
